---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Images">
  <h1>Images</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Writr supports a vault-friendly image workflow. Imported images are copied into your vault and referenced from notes.
  </p>

  <h2>Drag & drop</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Drop an image into the editor.</li>
    <li>Writr copies it to <code>~/Writr/image/</code>.</li>
    <li>Writr inserts a wikilink-style embed: <code>![[image/&lt;file&gt;]]</code>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Standard Markdown</h2>
  <p>
    You can also reference images like:
  </p>
  <pre><code>![](image/&lt;file&gt;)</code></pre>
</DocsLayout>

